# Native Linux server external viewer matrix.
# Columns: label|viewer|status|command|notes
#
# status:
#   ready   - command is executable by linux-server-external-viewer-matrix-smoke.sh
#   manual  - manual evidence is required; command must be manual:<reason>
#   missing - viewer is not available yet; command must be manual:<reason>
#
# Placeholders available to ready commands:
#   {host}
#   {port}
#   {password_file}
#
# Fill these with real client commands before claiming external compatibility.

tigervnc|TigerVNC vncviewer|missing|manual:install-tigervnc-viewer-and-run-again|Required external Linux viewer coverage.
libvnc|LibVNC vncviewer|missing|manual:install-libvncclient-viewer-and-run-again|Required libvncclient-based viewer coverage.
realvnc|RealVNC Viewer|manual|manual:run-gui-viewer-and-record-evidence|RealVNC is usually GUI/licensed; attach manual evidence.
ultravnc-windows|UltraVNC Viewer Windows|manual|manual:run-windows-viewer-against-linux-server|Run from Windows host against this Linux server.
